msgctxt "80"
msgid "Hey. What's going on in here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"Oh, we're making dessert! The lady next door gave us a lot of fruit, so "
"we're using some gelatin to make it into something tasty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "We're making pudding, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Looks delicious, you two. By the way, you didn't notice anyone hiding "
"around here, did you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "No, I don't think so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Wait, are you guys playing hide-and-seek? It's against the rules to ask for "
"help!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Right... I guess even your Uncle Kaz forgets the rules sometimes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Hey, you two didn't see anyone come hide in here, did you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Didn't you already ask us that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Come on, Uncle Kaz! It's against the rules to ask for help!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Oh yeah. I guess even your Uncle Kaz forgets the rules sometimes."
msgstr ""

